# Text here is LF in the repository and diffs normally.
* text=auto

# A vendored SDK is code signed, so its bytes are the artifact. Brother ships
# ten printer definition files per slice with CRLF, and _CodeSignature/
# CodeResources seals a SHA-1 and a SHA-256 of every resource it carries.
# Normalising one line ending breaks that seal, and nothing here builds, so
# nothing else would catch it. See CLAUDE.md.
Sources/** -text -diff
